OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of heavy rain spreading east
OL,7,Fthrough the evening. Further outbreaks
OL,8,Fof heavy rain overnight, perhaps
OL,9,Fthundery for a time, turning more
OL,10,Fshowery towards morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FBright spells and scattered
OL,13,Fshowers from the northwest through the
OL,14,Fday, occasionally heavy and thundery
OL,15,Fat first, lighter and more isolated
OL,16,Flater in the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
