OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FShowers Wednesday morning, becoming
OL,7,Fmostly dry and bright by midday. A
OL,8,Fband of heavy rain pushes east
OL,9,FWednesday evening. Frequent heavy
OL,10,Fshowers Thursday, easing Friday
OL,11,Fmorning, then further rain later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
